y to have conquerors haki out  of the first three admirals it's kizaru  but still like i said i wouldn't be  surprised if all admirals had conquerors  hockey before we jump to the new  admirals let's look at the now 79 year  old sengoku the buddha before he was  fleet admiral he too was an admiral he's  one of the ogs along with garp  whitebeard goldie roger captain rocks  and so on sengoku was one of the marines  that goldie roger respected the other  being garp at the battle of marineford  he is able to restrain garp and send all  of the skilled blackbeard pirates flying  backwards with one of his attacks he's  no longer in his prime but he's clearly  still one of the strongest characters in  the series he possesses the hitohito no  me model daibutsu aka the human human  fruit model buddha this is a mythical  zone fruit a class rarer than logia type  fruits this fruit allows its user to  transform into a large golden buddha his  strength is magnified in this form  giving his blows immense destructive  power he can also release powerful shock  waves in this form and it can be assumed  that he has one of the best defenses  when he's transformed sengoku unlike the  other skilled admirals on this list is  confirmed to be able to use all three  types of hockey including the rare  conquerors haki next we have one of the  new admirals the 54 year old isho known  also by his alias fujitora which means  wisteria tiger he's shorter than all the  previously mentioned admirals at 8 feet  10 inches tall but i'm sure for most of  us it's still pretty tall like who's on  fujitora is against the extremist view  of absolute justice as opposed to a  kainu who is willing to sacrifice the  innocent fujitora prioritizes protecting  people he is blind and says that he  earned his lack of sight by his own  actions and that he shut his eyelids on  his own after he saw too many things he  didn't care for however after an  encounter with luffy fujitora supposes  that he shouldn't have closed his eyes  because he wants to take a look at  luffy's face to see how such an honest  guy looks in front of the world fujitora  apologizes to the proper king of  dressrosa riku after doflamingo is  defeated and says that it was through  the actions of pirates gladiators and  citizens that the country seized victory  this is practically a kainu's worst  nightmare and fujitora even chooses not  to apologize to a kainu after doing it  fujitora an admiral admits in the open  that the marines can do the wrong thing  and make mistakes while pirates can do  the right thing and protect the innocent  you can't help but like the guy who's  willing to follow his own moral compass  no matter what his superior the fleet  admiral will think fujitora is strong  enough to easily block attacks from  former warlord doflamingo and luffy  during dressrosa couldn't do much to him  either except leave a positive  impression he could also clash with sabo  the number two ranked member of the  revolutionaries and an extremely skilled  fighter for an extended period of time  without taking any significant damage  now let's get into fujitora's devil  fruit the paramecia type zushizushi no  me this fruit gives him gravity powers  that he uses in conjunction with his  sword he can create gravitational forces  that move horizontally or vertically he  can use downward gravity to trap an  opponent in place or he can use  gravitational force to repel people and  things away from himself he can even  pull down meteorites from space madras  style even someone as skilled and  experienced as doflamingo couldn't  believe that this dude was bringing  actual meteorite down to earth fujitora  is also skilled at observation armament  haki furthermore he's been seeing  imbuing his sword with haki his  observation hockey is what lets him  fight effectively without vision he's so  good that he can even sense people's  emotions and thoughts not just their  fast physical movements and finally  we're here the 