owing a lot more  respect to the aqua commander than green  bull showed queen and king yes it's  likely in part because ben beckman is  stronger than king and queen but it  still could be read as greenville being  very strong even for an admiral and this  is also an interesting moment because  green bull with his actions and words  seems to confirm that most of the time  admirals are stronger than yanko  commanders perhaps not a shocking  revelation but interesting nonetheless  and it makes sense since if there are  usually three admirals at a time while  there are four yonko it would be weird  for the admirals to be struggling with  every yonko commander that being said it  does appear like marco and especially  ben beckman stand out as being pretty  special let me know right now in the  comments where would you rank greenville  in power compared to the other admirals  we've seen like kizaru fujitora and so  on i'd love to see how you guys rank the  admirals after these latest chapters  back to the chapter at hand though and  we even see green bull drinking beer  through his roots another potential clue  to him being zoro's father after  sakazuki told him not to cause any  trouble he does the complete opposite  and calls for a battleship to be sent to  him and even tells the listener not to  squeal to sakazuki so this dude is  acting on his own right now he says he  loves sakazuki's cut no corners attitude  and he says he wants to hear sakazuki's  praise when green bull brings him  luffy's head so just the fact that he  thinks he can take down everyone that  just brought down kaido and big mom also  speaks volumes about his confidence and  potential strength i personally don't  see him being a real threat to gear 5  luffy and his allied forces but it does  depend at least in part on how recovered  exactly our guys are to say the least it  should be interesting to see green bull  crash the party and i can't wait to see  what happens next now even though  aramaki's fruit hasn't been named yet it  is clearly related to plants in one way  or another however rather than just  being a vague plant logia or something  it could very well be something more  hype like a mythical zone model juboko  based on a japanese tree yokai that  thirsts for human blood since no admiral  except the legendary former fleet  admiral sengoku has had a mythical zone  so far and since it is the most rare and  hype category of fruit that would serve  to further distinguish green bull among  the already impressive admiral class if  you want to learn more about aramaki's  potential fruit and the juboco myth  definitely check out our why everyone is  afraid of admiral green bull video link  in the description but that's it for  today's video all six known admirals and  what we know about them so far and their  powers if you enjoyed this video make  sure to smash that like button to let me  know remember always be a smashing power  king rather than passing orochi and you  will be rewarded with youtube fireworks  if you haven't make this the video you  joined the nakama by subscribing and  hitting that notification bell to turn  on all notifications or you will miss  future one-piece videos and updates and  we all know this is definitely not the  time to be missing one piece let me know  what type of one piece video you would  like to see next in the comments and  while you wait for the next video to  drop feel free to check out my big and  growing one piece playlist that includes  videos on all the yonko warlords  supernova mythical zone fruits and much  more link to that is in the description  and on screen right now and until next  time see ya space cowboys

