ir bodies kuzon's logia powers like a  kain news are strong enough to  permanently change the climate of an  area as we saw with punk hazard what's  especially cool about kuzon yes pun  intended is that he can avoid the most  common threat of devil fruit users by  freezing the sea water below him thus if  he's ever in a position where he's about  to fall in and drown he can just freeze  the water below him he regularly uses  his freezing powers to travel across the  sea and the fact that he just bikes over  the sea makes him all the more awesome  not to mention hilarious what is perhaps  the most impressive thing about kusan's  power is how he is able to survive  hockey imbued attacks like they were  nothing for instance when whitebeard  stabbed through him with his haki imbued  weapon kuzon was able to come out of it  fine that's a whole other level of logia  mastery right there it appears like  kuzon was able to make a hole in his  body before the weapon penetrated him  and thus avoided the damage kuzon also  possesses observation haki and armament  haki and if my rational speculation  about akainu is correct it's almost  certain that kuzon who fought him for 10  days is also an unconfirmed conker's  hockey user if luffy agrees to let  yamato join the straw hats then there  are already three conquerors hockey  users on the straw hat crew alone namely  yamato zorro and luffy so it wouldn't  even be surprising if all admirals had  conquerors haki since the marines are a  much bigger organization and the straw  hats despite being much smaller already  have three users haki aside kuzon can  form sharp weapons out of his ice and  use them to attack his opponents all in  all kuzon is more than a force to be  reckoned with and if blackbeard truly  acquired the former admiral's loyalty  that's an insane addition to the  blackbeard pirates next let's look at  the currently 58 year old borsolino aka  kizuru his admiral alias means yellow  monkey the constantly grinning kizaru is  the only remaining admiral from the  pre-time skip trio since akainu was  promoted to fleet admiral and kuzon  resigned kisar was also tall at 9 foot  11 inches these three admirals towered  over most people in height and strength  borcelino is the oldest and that's also  reflected by the wrinkles on his face  his form of justice is explained by oda  to be unclear justice he's not as moral  as kuzon but he's also not as much of an  extremist as a kainu and wouldn't take  as much initiative as he does kizuru  prefers to follow orders rather than  lead in regards to combat he's among the  best he's extremely fast his logia lets  him attack and move at the speed of  light he clashed against legends like  silver's rayleigh and whitebeard and  came out fine he also eventually  attacked luffy after shanks's first mate  ben beckman threatened him and even  offered to go to wana when he found out  that big mom and kaido formed an  alliance think about how crazy that is  for a second kaido and big mom were the  two living yonko with the highest  bounties together they had a bounty  around 9 billion berries to put this in  perspective the pirate king gold d roger  had a bounty of around five and a half  billion berries and kizuru offers to go  to wano even akainu is like chill bro so  it's quite clear that kizoru is not only  extremely strong but practically  fearless now let's look at his devil  fruit power the pika pika nomi aka  glinklin fruit it allows kizuru to  create control and become light he can  shoot laser beams create lightsabers to  fight with and turn parts of his body  into light and then hit his opponents  with the force of light speed not only  can he travel at the speed of light he  can also use mirrors or reflective  surfaces to propel him so that he can  get to any point he wishes to almost  instantaneously as if he were  teleporting kizaru is also skilled at  using observation hockey and armament  hockey if i had to pick someone who's  least likely to have conquerors haki out  of the first three admirals it's kizaru  but still like i said i wouldn't be  surprised if all admirals had conquerors  hockey before we jump to the new  admirals let's look at the now 79 year  old sengoku the buddha before he was  fleet admiral he too was an admiral he's  one of the ogs along with garp  whitebeard goldie roger captain rocks  and so on sengoku was one of the marines  that goldie roger respected the other  being garp at the battle of marineford  he is able to restrain garp and send all  of the skilled blackbeard pirates flying  backwards with one of his attacks he's  no longer in his prime but he's clearly  still one of the strongest characters in  the series he possesses the hitohito no  me model daibutsu aka the human human  fruit model buddha this is a mythical  zone fruit a class rarer than logia type  fruits this fruit allows its user to  transform into a large golden buddha his  strength is magnified in this form  giving his blows immense destructive  power he can also release powerful shock  waves in this form and it can be assumed  that he has one of the best defenses  when he's transformed sengoku unlike the  other skilled admirals on this list is  confirmed to be able to use all three  types of hockey including the rare  conquerors haki next we have one of the  new admirals the 54 year old isho known  also by his alias fujitora which means  wisteria tiger he's shorter than all the  previously mentioned admirals at 8 feet  10 inches tall but i'm sure for most of  us it's still pretty tall like who's on  fujitora is against the extremist view  of absolute justice as opposed to a  kainu who is willing to sacrifice the  innocent fujitora prioritizes protecting  people he is blind and says that he  earned his lack of sight by his own  actions and that he shut his eyelids on  his own after he saw too many things he  didn't care for however after an  encounter with luffy fujitora supposes  that he shouldn't have closed his eyes  because he wants to take a look at  luffy's face to see how such an honest  guy looks in front of the world fujitora  apologizes to the proper king of  dressrosa riku after doflamingo is  defeated and says that it was through  the actions of pirates gladiators and  citizens that the country seized victory  this is practically a kainu's worst  nightmare and fujitora even chooses not  to apologize to a kainu after doing it  fujitora an admiral admits in the open  that the marines can do the wrong thing  and make mistakes while pirates can do  the right thing and protect the innocent  you can't help but like the guy who's  willing to follow his own moral compass  no matter what his superior the fleet  admiral will think fujitora is strong  enough to easily block attacks from  former warlord doflamingo and luffy  during dressrosa couldn't do much to him  either except leave a positive  impression he could also clash with sabo  the number two ranked member of the  revolutionaries and an extremely skilled  fighter for an extended period of time  without taking any significant damage  now let's get into fujitora's devil  fruit the paramecia type zushizushi no  me this fruit gives him gravity powers  that he uses in conjunction with his  sword he can create gravitational forces  that move horizontally or vertically he  can use downward gravity to trap an  opponent in place or he can use  gravitational force to repel people and  things away from himself he can even  pull down meteorites from space madras  style even someone as skilled and  experienced as doflamingo couldn't  believe that this dude was bringing  actual meteorite down to earth fujitora  is also skilled at observation armament  haki furthermore he's been seeing  imbuing his sword with haki his  observation hockey is what lets him  fight effectively without vision he's so  good that he can even sense people's  emotions and thoughts not just their  fast physical movements and finally  we're here the last admiral we have to  cover is ryokugyu aka aramaki the second  new admiral his alias means green bull  this is the admiral that we knew by far  the least about when i made the previous  version of this video up to that point  we just knew that his silhouette was  seen smiling and joking around with  fujitora even while akainu was mad at  the latter we knew greenball had long  wavy hair and wore a marine coat we also  knew he hadn't had a bite to eat for  three years but he did reveal his love  of pretty ladies we knew that he was  strong enough to clash along with fellow  admiral fujitora with the formidable  captains of the revolutionary army no  small feat especially for a man running  on an empty stomach doflamingo has said  that there are rumors that both of the  new marine admirals are powerful  monsters so it's quite possible that  green bull is on par or maybe even  stronger than fujitora and if i had to  bet i'd say he is stronger and that's  why he was saying for last as with all  of the other admirals he knows  observation armament haki in the last  version of the video i hyped up  greenville because as mentioned oda kept  him for last shrouded in mystery which  is usually what shonen authors do for  the stronger characters and after  reading the recent chapters of the manga  i must say oda did not disappoint there  were a lot of theories floating around  about green bull including that he had a  plant-based through power and that he  was actually zoro's father one of these  theories has already been confirmed kind  of the reasons i thought he might have a  plant-based power was because of the  green in his name and also the fact that  he didn't eat which suggested to me that  he might get his nutrients from  photosynthesis when he appeared in  chapter 1052 it looked good for this  theory since he was seen flying around  with a kind of flower helicopter  sticking out from his back gotta hand to  the admirals they definitely have  uniquely awesome ways of traveling at  this point sakazuki aka kainu is asking  him where he is through his snail phone  and green bull says in the air as if  that helps narrow it down it's moments  like this that seem to support the idea  of him being zorro's dad since zoro is  legendary for his lack of direction  sense as well anyways greenball finally  spots wano up ahead and sakazuki tells  him don't you dare make things any worse  and greenball simply says i know i know  g's then we head to the following  chapter where we see his strength level  face and fruit abilities at work  although his powers still look related  to plants his nutrient gaining process  is much more deadly than photosynthesis  we see him launching roots all over the  place that penetrate the former beast  pirates and he sucks nutrients from them  that way in turn the victims begin to  look dried up and old so i guess a  fujitora is similar to madara with his  meteor dropping powers green bull is  sort of similar to hashirama with his  wood style powers the craziest part is  that even king and queen two yonko  commanders with bounties of 1.32 billion  and 1.39 billion respectively are easily  dealt with now yes they were heard  during the fight and king is even shown  with bandages but still it's been a week  and luffy and zoro seem fine now so it's  still very impressive what green ball  was able to do furthermore despite the  fact that they were the strongest  commanders of the so-called strongest  creature in the world and the yonko with  the highest bounty greenville comments  that a guy in his position can't go  around getting beat by pirate  subordinates thus even if they were in  tip-top shape the implication is that  green bull would still crush them and  it's a big deal because we saw how ben  beckman spoke with admiral kizuru at the  paramount war and the respect he gave  him ben commanded him not to do anything  and at first at least kizuru put his  hands up and said oops you're ben  beckman clearly showing a lot more  respect to the aqua commander than green  bull showed queen and king yes it's  likely in part because ben beckman is  stronger than king and queen but it  still could be read as greenville being  very strong even for an admiral and this  is also an interesting moment because  green bull with his actions and words  seems to confirm that most of the time  admirals are stronger than yanko  commanders perhaps not a shocking  revelation but interesting nonetheless  and it makes sense since if there are  usually three admirals at a time while  there are four yonko it would be weird  for the admirals to be struggling with  every yonko commander that being said it  does appear like marco and especially  ben beckman stand out as being pretty  special let me know right now in the  comments where would you rank greenville  in power compared to the other admirals  we've seen like kizaru fujitora and so  on i'd love to see how you guys rank the  admirals after these latest chapters  back to the chapter at hand though and  we even see green bull drinking beer  through his roots another potential clue  to him being zoro's father after  sakazuki told him not to cause any  trouble he does the complete opposite  and calls for a battleship to be sent to  him and even tells the listener not to  squeal to sakazuki so this dude is  acting on his own right now he says he  loves sakazuki's cut no corners attitude  and he says he wants to hear sakazuki's  praise when green bull brings him  luffy's head so just the fact that he  thinks he can take down everyone that  just brought down kaido and big mom also  speaks volumes about his confidence and  potential strength i personally don't  see him being a real threat to gear 5  luffy and his allied forces but it does  depend at least in part on how recovered  exactly our guys are to say the least it  should be interesting to see green bull  crash the party and i can't wait to see  what happens next now even though  aramaki's fruit hasn't been named yet it  is clearly related to plants in one way  or another however rather than just  being a vague plant logia or something  it could very well be something more  hype like a mythical zone model juboko  based on a japanese tree yokai that  thirsts for human blood since no admiral  except the legendary former fleet  admiral sengoku has had a mythical zone  so far and since it is the most rare and  hype category of fruit that would serve  to further distinguish green bull among  the already impressive admiral class if  you want to learn more about aramaki's  potential fruit and the juboco myth  definitely check out our why everyone is  afraid of admiral green bull video link  in the description but that's it for  today's video all six known admirals and  what we know about them so far and their  powers if you enjoyed this video make  sure to smash that like button to let me  know remember always be a smashing power  king rather than passing orochi and you  will be rewarded with youtube fireworks  if you haven't make this the video you  joined the nakama by subscribing and  hitting that notification bell to turn  on all notifications or you will miss  future one-piece videos and updates and  we all know this is definitely not the  time to be missing one piece let me know  what type of one piece video you would  like to see next in the comments and  while you wait for the next video to  drop feel free to check out my big and  growing one piece playlist that includes  videos on all the yonko warlords  supernova mythical zone fruits and much  more link to that is in the description  and on screen right now and until next  time see ya space cowboys
 

